<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Fixlet>
    <Title>Warning - Applocker Rules exist but no Enforcement Mode is Set - Windows</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>There are Applocker rules defined but no Enforcement mode is set! This means the rule are <STRONG>ENFORCED</STRONG>.</P>
<P><A href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dd759115(v=ws.11).aspx">https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dd759115(v=ws.11).aspx</A></P>
<P>For general information or to report issues with C3 Protect content please visit GitHub here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Protect">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Protect</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>exists keys whose (exists keys of it and not exists value &quot;EnforcementMode&quot; of it) of key &quot;HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\SrpV2&quot; of native registry</Relevance>
    <Source>Internal</Source>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2016-05-17</SourceReleaseDate>
    <MIMEField>
    	<Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
    	<Value>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 21:19:04 +0000</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
  </Fixlet>
</BES>
